{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29064","headline":"伤故湖州李郎中 · 许浑","name":"伤故湖州李郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"政成身没共兴衰，乡路兵戈旅榇回。\n城上暮云凝鼓角，海边春草闭池台。\n经年未葬家人散，昨夜因斋故吏来。\n南北相逢皆掩泣，白苹洲暖百花开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}